cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this corpus or code, please cite the paper below."
title: "YouTube Safe Kids — toxicity filter: corpus and code"
abstract: >-
  Annotated corpus of 1,506 Brazilian Portuguese sentences transcribed from 251
  public YouTube videos, labelled by three raters into three toxicity levels,
  together with the training and evaluation code of a BERTimbau classifier and
  the web service that reranks children's video search results by an
  interpretable safety score.
type: dataset
license: MIT
